        "original_id": "42e3c134-32d1-516e-86fd-6337043e28b8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Glen Campbell\n- Products: Mr. 12 String Guitar\n- Topics: 1960s music, 1970s music, television variety shows\n\nFacts:\n- Glen Campbell released the instrumental folk album Mr. 12 String Guitar in 1966.\n- Mr. 12 String Guitar features Glen Campbell's 12-string guitar.\n- Glen Campbell was an American singer and guitarist.\n- Glen Campbell was best known for a series of hits in the 1960s and 1970s.\n- Glen Campbell hosted the CBS music and comedy variety show The Glen Campbell Goodtime Hour from January 1969 through June 1972.",
